 # Commit Open Entries
 
-| Field  | Value                |
-| ------ | -------------------- |
+| Field  | Value                                       |
+| ------ | ------------------------------------------- |
 | Issue  | re-cinq/HALEngine#59, re-cinq/HALEngine#105 |
-| Status | Implemented          |
